msgid "What&#8217;s new since 0.28.1"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"After two release candidates, we are happy to announce that Quarkus 1.0.0.Final has been released. You can read Quarkus 1.0's announcement https://quarkus.io/blog/announcing-quarkus-1-0/[here].\n"
"We have now our heads towards the future."
msgstr ""

msgid "Many thanks to all the communities we rely on and interact with to provide the Quarkus ecosystem:  Netty, Vert.x, RESTEasy, SmallRye, Hibernate, Neo4j, Undertow, PostgreSQL, Infinispan, Dekorate, Fabric8, Elytron, Apache Camel, Kogito, and many many more, not forgetting Kubernetes, GraalVM and OpenJDK."
msgstr ""

