msgid ""
"We had 2 release candidates to fix issues and improve developer experience and documentation.\n"
"While it was a tremendous amount of work, it was mostly a lot of small adjustments. That being said, there are a few things that should be highlighted and here is a retrospective of these 2 release candidates."
msgstr ""

msgid "If you are building native images with GraalVM, be sure to use 19.2.1. Support for 19.3.0 is planned for Quarkus 1.1."
msgstr ""

msgid "Quarkus Platform"
msgstr "Quarkusプラットフォーム"

msgid "If you create a new project using https://code.quarkus.io/, you will notice that the generated project now includes what we call the Platform BOM instead of the usual Quarkus BOM."
msgstr ""

msgid "What's the difference with the Quarkus BOM you are used to (and you can still use by tweaking the Maven properties)? Mostly that you will be able to use the full Quarkus ecosystem instead of just the core extensions."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"To better increase the Quarkus ecosystem, we have separated the notion of extension publication from the notion of Quarkus Core release.\n"
"Concretely today, it adds all the Apache Camel extensions but more are coming."
msgstr ""

msgid "SmallRye OpenAPI and Swagger UI upgrade"
msgstr ""

msgid "Both SmallRye OpenAPI and Swagger UI were upgraded, fixing several bugs the community reported."
msgstr ""

msgid "HttpServletRequest replacement"
msgstr ""

msgid "We had several reports of people being unable to inject `HttpServletRequest` in their JAX-RS resources anymore due to our move to Vert.x by default. RESTEasy now offers a common ground `HttpRequest` class that you can use be it with our Vert.x layer or with Undertow/Servlet."
msgstr ""

msgid "Security"
msgstr "セキュリティー"

msgid "There were quite a lot of fixes and improvements to our security layer."
msgstr ""

msgid "Persistence"
msgstr ""

msgid "Infinispan was upgraded to 10.0.0.Final. We also upgraded Hibernate ORM to fix a few issues."
msgstr ""

msgid "Spring compatibility layer"
msgstr ""

msgid "Our Spring compatibility layer got significantly improved thanks to our community's reports and pull requests. Keep them coming!"
msgstr ""

msgid "Sending email with Gmail"
msgstr ""

msgid "We had several reports of people not being able to send emails using our Mailer extension and Gmail. It was a documentation issue and it has been updated to cover more Gmail use cases."
msgstr ""

msgid "Gradle and Kotlin"
msgstr ""

msgid "We fixed a number of issues with our Gradle integration and our Kotlin extension. Contributions in this area are highly welcome!"
msgstr ""

msgid "You might have scary unrecommended dependency warnings when using Gradle, this is due to some isolation problems between the Gradle build class loader and ours. Don't worry about it for now, we have a plan to fix it soon."
msgstr ""

msgid "Come Join Us"
msgstr "参加のお誘い"

msgid "We value your feedback a lot so please report bugs, ask for improvements... Let's build something great together!"
msgstr "私達は皆様からのフィードバックに重きを置いています。バグ報告、改善要望を是非お願いします。一緒に素晴らしいものを作り上げていきましょう!"

msgid "If you are a Quarkus user or just curious, don't be shy and join our welcoming community:"
msgstr "Quarkusユーザーの場合でも、単に興味を持っているだけの場合でも、恥ずかしがらずにコミュニティに参加して下さい!:"

msgid "provide feedback on https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub];"
msgstr "https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub] でフィードバック"

msgid "craft some code and https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pulls[push a PR];"
msgstr "コードを作成し、 https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pulls[プルリクエスト] を送信"

msgid "discuss with us on https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/[Zulip] and on the https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[mailing list];"
msgstr "https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/[Zulip] や https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[メーリングリスト] でディスカッションに参加"

msgid "ask your questions on https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/quarkus[Stack Overflow]."
msgstr "https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/quarkus[Stack Overflow] で質問"
